    "text": "Feria II in letania maiore.\nMen \u00f0a leofestan, us is swi\u00f0e mycel neod\u00feearf \u00fe\u00e6t we gehyron sumne d\u00e6l \u00feyses gastlican gewrites \u00fee\nUs is \u00feonne swy\u00f0e mycel neod\u00feearf on \u00e6ghwilce tide \u00fe\u00e6t we habban mid us so\u00f0e sibbe and so\u00f0e\nUton we \u00feonne ge\u00feencan \u00fe\u00e6t we mihton drihtene mid \u00fe\u00e6re m\u00e6stan eadmodnysse on \u00feas \u00fery dagas\nUton we \u00feonne on \u00feysum dagum and on \u00e6ghwylce tide gehyran and gehealdan his beboda.\nUton gehyron \u00e6t \u00e6restan and ge\u00feencan \u00feone cwyde \u00fee he sylf on his godspelle cw\u00e6\u00f0 and us bebead\nAnd getreowlice we magon ongytan \u00fe\u00e6t se \u00e6lmihtiga drihten swy\u00f0e m\u00e6nigfealdlice gyfe gemetf\u00e6stum\nFor \u00f0an \u00f0e he manncynne onlyhte m\u00e6nige gastlice leohtfatu and sende hider on \u00feisne middaneard for\nAnd swylce he eac wolde \u00fe\u00e6t we \u00feises leohtes andweardnysse geearnodon \u00fe\u00e6t we moston on \u00fe\u00e6re\nM\u00e6nig mann on \u00feysum gemote wuna\u00f0 and hw\u00e6\u00f0ere n\u00e6f\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t andgyt hw\u00e6t \u00fea gastlican leoht synd\nHi us onlihton and onstealdon eallra goddra weorca bysne.\nEac \u00fea w\u00e6ron godes \u00fea halgan witegan \u00fea \u00feurh \u00feone halgan gast us l\u00e6rdon.\nAnd hi us fore s\u00e6don ealles \u00feises middaneardes f\u00e6gernyssa and his wynsumnyssa.\nAnd eac swylce hy us fore s\u00e6don ealles \u00feises middaneardes \u00feysternyssa and his synna and his\nAc hi us eac s\u00e6don ymbe \u00fea toweardnysse \u00fe\u00e6s forhtigendan domes and \u00feone so\u00f0f\u00e6stan deman crist\nAnd eac \u00feyssere tacnunge hy eac getacnodon hwylc w\u00e6s heofona rice to geearnienne and hwylc w\u00e6s\nSwylce he cw\u00e6\u00f0 se ylca witega \u00fe\u00e6t n\u00e6re n\u00e6fre on hellewyte swa mycel wynsumes swa anes fugeles\nSwylce eac w\u00e6ron us to leohtfatum gesette cristes apostolas \u00fea w\u00e6ron onsende on \u00feysne middaneard\n\u00dee eor\u00f0lican ic onsende an sceap on wulfa heap.\nNe w\u00e6ron hy swa fr\u00e6cne onsended for \u00f0on \u00f0e hi h\u00e6fdon \u00fe\u00e6t gastlice m\u00e6gen and \u00feone heofonlican\n\u00deone fultum hi geearnedon \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fee hy w\u00e6ron cristes willan wyrcende for \u00fean hi sitta\u00f0 on heofonan\nBro\u00feor mine, hw\u00e6t we leornodon \u00fe\u00e6t cristes apostolas w\u00e6ron mennisce menn on \u00fea gelicnysse \u00fee we\nWe \u00feonne leornodon \u00fe\u00e6t hi geearnodon \u00fe\u00e6t rice and \u00fe\u00e6t setl \u00fe\u00e6t hi on wunia\u00f0 on heofonan rices\nNe synd we n\u00e6fre to ofermode on urum yfelum d\u00e6dum ac we hra\u00f0e to \u00fe\u00e6re anddetnysse and to \u00fe\u00e6re\nMicel gegearnung \u00fe\u00e6t is menniscum menn \u00fe\u00e6t he geearnige mid godum d\u00e6dum to \u00feam \u00e6lmihtigan\nSwa cristes apostolas dydon and habba\u00f0 geearnod \u00fe\u00e6t heora \u00e6ghwylc an m\u00e6g eallum manncynne\nUton we \u00feonne, bro\u00f0or mine, on \u00feas halgan tide geornfullice and eadmodlice biddan \u00feone \u00e6lmihtigan\nAnd we eac biddan \u00fea halgan apostolas \u00fea w\u00e6ron on gebyrdon \u00e6fter lichamlicre wisan us gelice.\nAnd hi us w\u00e6ron to leohtfatum gesette \u00fe\u00e6t hy syndon ure \u00feingeras to \u00feam lyfgendan gode \u00fe\u00e6t we\nSwylce eac us syndon to lareowum gesette ure \u00fea gehalgodon bisceopas \u00fea us trymma\u00f0 and l\u00e6ra\u00f0 to\nAnd eac swylce us syndon to lareowum gesette ure m\u00e6ssepreostas \u00fea beo\u00f0 d\u00e6ghwamlice anwearde\nMenig mann nafa\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t andgyt hw\u00e6t seo acennednysse sy.\nWe beo\u00f0 acenned lichamlice \u00feurh f\u00e6der and \u00feurh modor hider on \u00feisne middangeard \u00e6fter \u00feam we\n\u00dereo acennednyssa beo\u00f0 gastlice swa drihten sylf on hys godspelle sprecende w\u00e6s and \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0, Ne\n\u00c6ghwylc \u00fe\u00e6ra \u00fee on me gelyfa\u00f0 and gefullod bi\u00f0 \u00feurh w\u00e6ter and f\u00e6der namann and on sunu and on\n\u00de\u00e6t is seo forme accennednyss gastlicu \u00feonne we onfo\u00f0 fullwihte \u00e6t ure m\u00e6ssepreosta \u00feenunge.\n\u00deonne is seo \u00e6ftre accennednyss gastlicu sy\u00f0\u00f0an se mann gewintrod bi\u00f0 and \u00fe\u00e6t geseald hafa\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he\n\u00deonne is seo \u00feridde accennednyss \u00e6fter \u00feam so\u00f0an andetnyssa sy\u00f0\u00f0an se mann gewintrad bi\u00f0 and he\nHe geanlicode his lichaman heofonlican hlafe and he onlihte his blod wine on lifes calice and us \u00fea\nAnd swylce us w\u00e6ron to leohtfatum gesette and to lareowum \u00fea halgan godspelleras \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6ara lare\nSwa he drihten sylfa on his godspelle sprecende w\u00e6s be \u00feyssere halgan tide and be his godspellerum\nAnd ic wille \u00e6ghwylcum gemiltsian \u00fee \u00f0as halgan tide weor\u00f0ia\u00f0 and on me gelyfa\u00f0 and mid\nFor \u00feon, bro\u00f0or mine, on \u00feas andweardan tide beo\u00f0 reliquias haligra manna upp ahafene and for\u00f0\nUs is \u00feonne swy\u00f0e mycel nyd\u00feearf \u00fe\u00e6t we mid swi\u00f0e mycelre eadmodnysse urum reliquium folgion\nSwa we magon ongytan be sumre eor\u00f0licre bysne gyf menn him beo\u00f0 betweonan ungesibsume him\nSy\u00f0\u00f0an sceal \u00e6lc mann gel\u00e6stan swa se dema him bebeoda\u00f0 and \u00fe\u00e6t gemot bi\u00f0 \u00feonne eall gesybod.\nBe \u00fe\u00e6re bysne we magon ongytan \u00feas halgan tide for \u00fean \u00f0e \u00feas dagas syndon ure gemotdagas\nSwa on cyrican swa butan swa on hwylcre stowe hi on gesette beo\u00f0.\nWite \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6ghwylc mann \u00fe\u00e6ra \u00fee on \u00feysum gemote wunige and \u00feis godspell gehyre\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he\nHis domas he on gastlicum gewritum us gesette and \u00feurh gastlice leorneras us ontynde.\nGyf we \u00feas gastlican domas gel\u00e6sta\u00f0 willa\u00f0 \u00fee crist sylf on his godspelle beoda\u00f0 on \u00feisse gemotstowe\nBro\u00f0or mine, us is swy\u00f0e mycel nyd\u00feearf \u00fe\u00e6t us \u00feys godspell gerecce mid hwylcum d\u00e6dum.\nWe sceolon \u00feone so\u00f0f\u00e6stan deman weor\u00f0ian and him \u00feeowian.\nAerest on \u00feysse halgan tide \u00fee nu onweard his and swa hyt gecweden hys on \u00feysum godspelle \u00fe\u00e6t we\nAnd \u00feonne on ymbwyrfte \u00fe\u00e6ra gastlicra lofsanga eall folc gewunie and nan mann hine sylfne ne\nFor \u00fean \u00f0e \u00e6lcum \u00fe\u00e6ra bi\u00f0 heofonan rices duru ontyned \u00fee mid so\u00f0an geleafan \u00feam halgum reliquium\nAnd \u00e6gwylc mann gehealde cl\u00e6nlice his f\u00e6sten \u00feas \u00fery dagas o\u00f0 \u00f0a nontide and \u00feonne \u00feicge \u00fea\nUton we nu \u00feone ge\u00feencann \u00fe\u00e6t we swy\u00f0e medemlice gedydon \u00fe\u00e6ge tide ge ure f\u00e6sten ge ure\nSe mann se \u00f0e \u00f0ence\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he leohte candele gewyrce \u00fe\u00e6t he m\u00e6ge lyhtan mid nihtlicum \u00feystrum on\nNafast \u00f0u \u00e6t \u00feam tapore n\u00e6nig leoht ne n\u00e6nig recc gyf he \u00fe\u00e6re smyrennysse ne underfeh\u00f0.\nSwa \u00feonne bi\u00f0 \u00feam menn \u00fee cwy\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he wile f\u00e6stan for naman \u00fe\u00e6s \u00e6lmihtigan drihtenes and \u00feonne\nAnd \u00feeah \u00fee he \u00feone cristes \u00feearfan geseo \u00fe\u00e6nne \u00feenc\u00f0 he \u00fe\u00e6t he nelle \u00e6g\u00f0er ge f\u00e6sten ge eac \u00feone\n\u00deonne \u00feenc\u00f0 he, Ne wille ic mine \u00e6rende abeodan \u00e6r his hrif gereordod sy for \u00fean \u00fee hi oft onleton\nBro\u00f0or mine, ne bi\u00f0 swylc f\u00e6sten gecoren \u00feam so\u00f0f\u00e6stan deman.\nAc gyf \u00feu wille medomlice f\u00e6stan for naman \u00fe\u00e6s \u00e6lmihtigan drihtenes \u00feonne gefylst \u00feone cwyde \u00fee\nSwa sceal se mann don se \u00f0e wyle rihtwislice f\u00e6stan for naman \u00fe\u00e6s \u00e6lmihtigan drihtenes.\nAc se mann se \u00fee \u00feenc\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he cl\u00e6nlice f\u00e6ste and \u00feonne eac \u00feence\u00f0 to wrace worda and d\u00e6da \u00feam \u00fee\nSwa bi\u00f0 \u00feam gaste his weg to \u00feam ecean life gebyrhte\u00f0 gyf se man bi\u00f0 on f\u00e6stene geunrotsod.\nFor \u00f0on us is swi\u00f0e mycel nyd\u00feearf \u00fe\u00e6t we swy\u00f0e eadmodlice gedon ure f\u00e6sten ge ure \u00e6lmyssan ge\nGyf we swa wylla\u00f0 don and \u00feas lare gel\u00e6stan \u00feonne magon we geearnian mid \u00feam lastum\nAnd eac swylce we magon geearnian \u00feurh ure cl\u00e6ne f\u00e6sten forgyfnysse ealra \u00fe\u00e6ra unnytt \u00e6ta \u00fee we\nAnd eac \u00fe\u00e6t mare is eallra ura synna forgyfnysse gyf we ne forgymeleasia\u00f0 on \u00feas andweardan tide\nEalne godes dom we magon \u00feurh \u00fereo \u00feing gehealdan \u00fe\u00e6t syndon \u00fea \u00fereo \u00feing \u00fe\u00e6t se mann hine\nSe goda ge\u00feoht onbryrde\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s mannes heortan to \u00feam godum d\u00e6dum.\nBro\u00f0or mine, \u00feysum we magon geearnian \u00fe\u00e6t we moton lyfian and on blisse beon mid drihten sylfum",
